  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 8.7.x\n### All packages\n* Added .NET 10 TFM\n* Updated to C# Language Version 14\n* Converted extension methods to C# 14 extension members\n* Removed deprecated code\n* Enabled Trim Analyzer for package\n* Marked package with ``<IsTrimmable>`` set to true.\n### MsExtensions package\n* Updated to Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives from 9.0.10 to 10.0.0\n* Updated to Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions from 9.0.10 to 10.0.0\n* Converted StringValues and StringSegment``IsEmpty`` extension methods to C# 14 extension properties\n* Converted StringValues and StringSegment ``IsNullOrWhitespace`` extension methods to C# 14 static extension member method\n* Removed StringSegment non-null ``IsNullOrWhitespace`` extension method",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
